rdinal, natural order already meaningful)\n","6. **Train-Test Split**\n","   - `test_size=0.2`, `stratify=y` (dataset is imbalanced: ~62% not survived, ~38% survived)\n","7. **Feature Scaling**\n","   - `StandardScaler` — `fit_transform` on `X_train`, only `transform` on `X_test` (avoid data leakage)\n","8. **Model Training**\n","   - `LogisticRegression().fit(X_train_scaled, y_train)`\n","9. **Evaluation**\n","   - Accuracy, Confusion Matrix, Precision/Recall/F1\n","   - Baseline accuracy = ~61.6% (\"always predict not survived\")\n","   - First model result: Accuracy = 82.1%, Recall(Survived) = 0.70 — model slightly biased toward predicting \"not survived\" due to class imbalance\n","\n","### Goal for This Round\n","Re-run the full pipeline with `FamilySize`, `IsAlone`, and `Title` added, and compare new accuracy/recall against the baseline (82.1% / 0.70) to see if feature engineering improved the model."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"86a4b40a","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.01605,"end_time":"2026-08-09T14:59:37.127781+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-08-09T14:59:37.111731+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["# Round 2"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"cf307479","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.018238,"end_time":"2026-08-09T14:59:37.161962+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-08-09T14:59:37.143724+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 1. Load and inspect data"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":42,"id":"f11a62d3","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-09T14:59:37.195937Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-09T14:59:37.19517Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-09T14:59:37.215216Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-09T14:59:37.214337Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.039166,"end_time":"2026-08-09T14:59:37.217164+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-08-09T14:59:37.177998+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"data":{"text/html":["<div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr t